<title>FRANCE: Generale des Eaux H1 sales rise 6.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Generale des Eaux H1 sales rise 6.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>     Turnover				    80.9  vs    78.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Generale des Eaux said sales were up eight percent at constant structure and 6.5 percent on a like-for-like basis. Sales in telecoms were up 70 percent to five billion francs. If property is stripped out, sales were up 12.4 percent at a like for like basis. Sales increase on like-for like basis in pct</p>
<p>			France	  International     Total</p>
<p>Environment	  2.0		 24.0		 8.5</p>
<p>Construction	 2.0	     - 11.0	     - 2.5</p>
<p>Communication     70.0		 n/a		 67.0</p>
<p>Total		  5.5		 9.0		  6.5</p>
